  "ruleText": "Csp 703.05 Appeal of Residency Determination. Any appeal of the determination of residency shall be made to the institution and shall be adjudicated by the institution’s published appeal process.\n\nSource. #8623, eff 5-4-06, EXPIRED: 5-4-14\n\nNew. #11099, eff 5-17-16; ss by #13302, eff 12-10-21\n\nAPPENDIX",
